TEXT -416 -272 Left 3 ;Capacitor ESR - and especially C2 - put a lower limit on the noise of this circuit. For the cap shown with an ESR of 120mOhms, \nit is about 60 pico V/rt Hz. C2 should be a low ESR type, or made up of a number of low ESR types in parallel. D1 allows C2 to\ndischarge quickly as does D2 for C1
